# ---- build output -------------------------------------------------------
# Built kexts are never committed.  A .kext is a binary artifact, and this
# repository is about the source that produces it.
build/
outputs/
*.kext
*.o
*.o.err
*.dSYM/
cx3ctl

# ---- third-party proprietary binaries -----------------------------------
# NEVER commit these, not even while the repository is private.
#
# Git history is permanent: once such an object exists in a commit it stays
# reachable from that commit even after the file is deleted, so turning the
# repository public later would republish it.  Removing it then requires a
# history rewrite (filter-repo / BFG), which changes every commit hash.
# Keeping them out from the first commit costs nothing.
#
# The ATTO FastFrame kext is Mellanox's own cna2 code shipped under an ATTO
# badge (see docs/M1-NOTES.md section 9.2); it is proprietary.  The other names
# below are third-party vendor kexts from this machine's driver backups.
ATTO*
atto*
*.dmg
*.pkg
NVRM*
NVAccel*
NVRMFB*
NVRMAGDC*
HighPoint*
state-backup-*

# ---- local state --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
*.swp
__pycache__/
.codegraph/
